    },
    "body": "1.  In the driver app from the deliver tab, hard press where you want to drop a custom marker.         2.  Choose the type marker from the dropdown list and enter your notes or code. .    .     3.  To view notes or codes for a custom marker, hard press on the marker and click the red pen icon. .",
